# Regions of demos' screenshots that TempleOS draws from the time, so they
# differ between any two runs (tools/compare_shots.py --masks).
# SHOT X0 Y0 X1 Y1, ends exclusive. 10-scrnmemory needs none.

# Top line (clock, CPU meters) and the window title row: titles scroll.
20-hanoi      0   0 640  16
30-palette    0   0 640  16
99-end        0   0 640  16
# The AutoComplete window's title bar, which scrolls too.
20-hanoi    392  96 640 104
30-palette  392  96 640 104
99-end      392  96 640 104
# Hanoi's towers and move counter: how far the animation has got.
20-hanoi      0 344 320 472
# The shell's timing of the previous command.
30-palette    8  16  96  24
99-end        8  16  96  24
# PressAKey's blinking prompts and the cursor blink.
30-palette    8 168  96 192
99-end        8 168  96 192
